sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Staff
    participant W as Web<br/>Client
    participant R as Routers<br/>+ Auth
    participant I as Import<br/>Pipeline
    participant E as Event<br/>Manager
    participant L as Identity<br/>Linker
    participant D as PostgreSQL

    S->>W: Drop "Bagel Breakfast<br/>- November.csv"
    W->>R: POST /api/imports
    R->>R: Check login
    R->>I: Detect source<br/>from header row
    alt Headers match no known export
        I-->>W: 422: lists the missing columns
    else CampusGroups or 12twenty export
        I->>E: File SHA-256
        E->>D: Imported before?
        alt Same file already imported
            E-->>W: 409: already imported, nothing added
        else New file
            I->>I: Validate rows,<br/>flag missing values
            I->>D: Save as pending import
            E-->>W: Preview + pre-filled event details
            S->>W: Confirm date,<br/>term, type, host
            W->>R: POST .../commit
            R->>I: Normalize to<br/>GPSRC layout
            I->>L: Normalized<br/>rows
            L->>D: Find person:<br/>NetID, then email
            L->>D: One transaction:<br/>event, file, rows
            L-->>W: Summary: added, linked, flagged
        end
    end
